Spec 34 Part D: Vulkan on iOS in win32u's vulkan.c. The host driver is the iOS layer of part 34,
linked (D1: dlopen/dlsym/dlclose mapped by vulkan_ios.h); every host instance, device and surface
is recorded with its pseudo-process and released when it ends (D7); swapchains are always
stretch-scaled and a layer-size VK_SUBOPTIMAL_KHR is hidden when the swapchain has the window's
size (D3); the device LUID is the one DXGI reports (D4). The code is vulkan_ios.inc, included at
the end. Applied after spec 12's, 17's and 22's patches; no earlier patch touches this file.

